# TeamSync AI — Architecture Diagrams (PPT Ready)

> All diagrams are Mermaid-compatible for direct embedding into slides, Notion, or Markdown renderers.

---

## 1. High-Level System Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Electron Desktop App"
        UI["React Frontend<br/>(Overlay UI)"]
        IPC["IPC Bridge<br/>(preload.ts)"]
        Main["Main Process<br/>(main.ts)"]
    end

    subgraph "Core Engine Layer"
        IM["IntelligenceManager<br/>Session Lifecycle"]
        IE["IntelligenceEngine<br/>Action Pipeline"]
        ST["SessionTracker<br/>Transcript + State"]
        LH["LLMHelper<br/>Generation Router"]
    end

    subgraph "Intelligence Layer"
        QU["QuestionUnderstanding V2"]
        RDE["ResponseDepthEstimator"]
        PE["PlanningEngine"]
        BL["Brain Layer<br/>(6 Domain Brains)"]
        CPE["ContextPriorityEngine"]
        QE["Quality Evaluator"]
        RJA["Resume×JD Analyzer"]
    end

    subgraph "LLM Infrastructure"
        PR["ProviderRegistry<br/>Multi-Provider"]
        MR["ModelRouter<br/>Fallback Chains"]
        TB["TokenBudget<br/>9K Cap Enforcer"]
        IC["IntentClassifier<br/>Regex + SLM"]
    end

    subgraph "RAG Pipeline"
        RM["RAGManager"]
        EP["EmbeddingPipeline"]
        VS["VectorStore<br/>(SQLite + sqlite-vec)"]
        LI["LiveRAGIndexer<br/>JIT Indexing"]
    end

    subgraph "Audio / Vision"
        AC["SystemAudioCapture"]
        MC["MicrophoneCapture"]
        STT["STT Providers<br/>(Deepgram/OpenAI/Google)"]
        SH["ScreenshotHelper"]
        VP["VisionPipeline<br/>OCR + Tesseract"]
        SSL["ScreenScanLLM"]
    end

    subgraph "Persistence"
        DB["SQLite (better-sqlite3)"]
        MP["MeetingPersistence"]
        CM["CalendarManager"]
    end

    UI --> IPC --> Main
    Main --> IM --> IE
    IE --> ST
    IE --> LH
    IE --> QU & RDE & PE & BL & CPE & QE
    BL --> RJA
    LH --> PR --> MR
    LH --> TB
    LH --> IC
    IE -.->|RAG context| RM
    RM --> EP --> VS
    RM --> LI
    AC & MC --> STT --> ST
    SH --> VP --> SSL
    ST --> MP --> DB
    CM --> DB
```

---

## 2. Intelligence Pipeline — `runAction()` Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A["runAction(params)"] --> B{"Request Dedupe<br/>& Ownership Check"}
    B -->|Duplicate| Z1["Return cached"]
    B -->|New| C["AbortController + Signal"]
    C --> D["buildContext()<br/>ActionContextBuilder"]
    D --> E["QuestionUnderstandingV2<br/>Category + Confidence"]
    E --> F["ResponseDepthEstimator<br/>short / medium / deep"]
    F --> G{"PlanningEngine V1"}
    G --> H{"isPlanConfident?<br/>(≥ 0.45)"}
    H -->|Yes| I["Inject reasoningPlan<br/>into Brain input"]
    H -->|No| J["Skip plan<br/>(fallback-safe)"]
    I & J --> K["BrainSelector.select()<br/>Route to Domain Brain"]
    K --> L["Brain.execute()<br/>Generate instructions"]
    L --> M["ContextPriorityEngine<br/>Rank + Order sources"]
    M --> N["Merge brain instructions<br/>into PromptObject"]
    N --> O["TokenBudgetEnforcer<br/>9K cap"]
    O --> P["PromptValidator"]
    P --> Q["LLM Streaming<br/>(Multi-Provider)"]
    Q --> R["ActionOutputValidator"]
    R --> S{"Quality<br/>Acceptable?"}
    S -->|Repair| T["buildRepairInstruction()<br/>+ Retry (max 1)"]
    T --> Q
    S -->|Pass| U["ResponseQualityEvaluator<br/>(Observation-only logging)"]
    U --> V["Emit action_result<br/>+ Stream to UI"]

    style G fill:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style K fill:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
    style Q fill:#51cf66,color:#fff
    style U fill:#ffd43b,color:#333
```

