## 3. Brain Layer Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "BrainSelector"
        BS["select(analysis, options)"]
        BS -->|coding| CB
        BS -->|system_design| SDB
        BS -->|behavioral| BB
        BS -->|resume_jd| RB
        BS -->|screen_scan| SAB
        BS -->|general/fallback| GB
    end

    subgraph "Domain Brains"
        CB["CodingBrain<br/>Algorithm + Complexity"]
        SDB["SystemDesignBrain<br/>Architecture + Tradeoffs"]
        BB["BehavioralBrain<br/>STAR Pattern"]
        RB["ResumeBrain<br/>JD Alignment"]
        SAB["ScreenAnalysisBrain<br/>Vision Context"]
        GB["GeneralBrain<br/>Direct Answer"]
    end

    subgraph "Brain Output"
        BO["BrainOutput"]
        BO --- I1["instructions[]<br/>Namespaced keys"]
        BO --- I2["contextPriority<br/>Source rankings"]
        BO --- I3["streamStrategy<br/>adaptive/standard"]
        BO --- I4["reasoningPlan?<br/>Plan-aware emphasis"]
    end

    CB & SDB & BB & RB & SAB & GB --> BO

    subgraph "BrainRegistry"
        BR["Registry<br/>id → Brain mapping"]
        BR -->|get(id)| CB & SDB & BB & RB & SAB & GB
    end

    style BS fill:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style BO fill:#51cf66,color:#fff
```

