## 4. RAG Pipeline — Retrieval-Augmented Generation

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph "Ingestion (Post-Meeting)"
        T1["Raw Transcript<br/>Segments"] --> PP["TranscriptPreprocessor<br/>Clean + Normalize"]
        PP --> SC["SemanticChunker<br/>Boundary Detection"]
        SC --> VS1["VectorStore.saveChunks()"]
        VS1 --> EQ["EmbeddingQueue<br/>(SQLite)"]
        EQ --> EP1["EmbeddingPipeline<br/>Background Processing"]
    end

    subgraph "Embedding Providers"
        EP1 --> GP["Gemini Embeddings"]
        EP1 --> OP["OpenAI Embeddings"]
        EP1 --> LP["Local MiniLM<br/>(On-device Fallback)"]
        GP & OP & LP --> VS2["VectorStore<br/>storeEmbedding()"]
    end

    subgraph "JIT RAG (Live Meeting)"
        LS["Live Segments"] --> LI1["LiveRAGIndexer"]
        LI1 -->|"5-segment batches"| SC2["SemanticChunker"]
        SC2 --> EP2["EmbeddingPipeline"]
        EP2 --> VS2
    end

    subgraph "Retrieval (Query Time)"
        Q["User Query"] --> RR["RAGRetriever"]
        RR -->|Scope Detection| SD{"meeting or global?"}
        SD -->|meeting| MR1["Meeting-scoped search"]
        SD -->|global| GR["Cross-meeting search"]
        MR1 & GR --> VSW["vectorSearchWorker<br/>(Worker Thread)"]
        VSW --> VS2
        VSW --> RC["Ranked Chunks"]
        RC --> BP["buildRAGPrompt()"]
        BP --> LLM["LLM Streaming"]
    end

    style LI1 fill:#ffd43b,color:#333
    style VSW fill:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style LP fill:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
```

---

## 5. OCR & Screen Capture Pipeline

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A["User Trigger<br/>(Hotkey / Button)"] --> B["ScreenshotHelper"]
    B --> C{"Multi-Display?"}
    C -->|Single| D["captureWithDesktopCapturer()<br/>Electron API"]
    C -->|Multi| E["getDisplaysIntersectingSelection()"]
    E --> F["stitchImages()<br/>Sharp compositing"]
    D & F --> G["PNG saved to disk"]
    G --> H["VisionPipeline"]

    H --> I["extractScreenTextHybrid()"]
    I --> J["Resize > 1600px → 1280px"]
    J --> K["Hash-based dedup<br/>(lastScreenHash)"]
    K -->|No change| L["Return __NO_CHANGE__"]
    K -->|Changed| M["Tesseract OCR<br/>(Primary)"]
    M --> N{"isLowQualityScreenText?"}
    N -->|Good| O["Return OCR text"]
    N -->|Bad| P["Python OCR Worker<br/>(Fallback subprocess)"]
    P --> O

    O --> Q["ScreenScanLLM"]
    Q --> R["detectScreenContentMode()"]
    R --> S{"Content Type"}
    S -->|coding| T["Code Analysis Prompt"]
    S -->|interview| U["Interview Answer Prompt"]
    S -->|slides| V["Slide Intelligence Prompt"]
    S -->|document| W["Document Insights Prompt"]
    S -->|ui_general| X["General Screen Analysis"]

    T & U & V & W & X --> Y{"isGoodOCR?"}
    Y -->|Yes| Z1["Text + Image → LLM"]
    Y -->|No| Z2["Vision Fallback<br/>(Image only → LLM)"]

    style H fill:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style R fill:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
    style P fill:#ffd43b,color:#333
```

