## 6. Knowledge Orchestration V2

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A["RetrieveContextParams<br/>(analysis, session, intent)"] --> B["KnowledgeOrchestratorV2"]
    B --> C{"Priority Mode?"}

    C -->|Legacy (Phase 3a)| D["Delegate to<br/>buildContext()"]
    D --> E["builtLayersToContextBundle()<br/>Adapter"]
    E --> F["ContextBundle"]

    C -->|Priority (Phase 3b)| G["Build Sources<br/>Independently"]
    G --> H["1. Transcript Source"]
    G --> I["2. Profile Intelligence"]
    G --> J["3. RAG Memory"]
    G --> K["4. Supplemental Context"]
    G --> L["5. Mode Custom Context"]

    H & I & J & K & L --> M["ContextPrioritizer<br/>prioritizeSources()"]
    M --> N["packIntoBudget()<br/>Greedy token packing"]
    N --> F

    F --> O["PromptAssembler<br/>→ PromptObject"]

    style B fill:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style M fill:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
    style F fill:#51cf66,color:#fff
```

