## 7. Multi-Provider LLM Routing

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph "ProviderRegistry"
        GC["Gemini<br/>(Flash / Pro)"]
        OC["OpenAI<br/>(GPT-5.4)"]
        CC["Claude<br/>(Sonnet 4-6)"]
        GQ["Groq<br/>(Llama 3.3 70B)"]
        OL["Ollama<br/>(Local)"]
        NT["Natively API"]
        CP["Custom / cURL"]
    end

    MR["ModelRouter"] --> PRI["prioritizeProviders()"]
    PRI -->|"1. Natively (if key)"| NT
    PRI -->|"2. User's selected"| GC & OC & CC & GQ
    PRI -->|"3. Remaining"| OL & CP

    MR --> SF["streamWithFallback()"]
    SF -->|"Try provider"| P1["Provider 1"]
    P1 -->|Fail| P2["Provider 2"]
    P2 -->|Fail| P3["Provider 3"]
    P3 -->|"All fail"| RETRY["Exponential Backoff<br/>+ Rotate (3x)"]

    subgraph "ModelVersionManager"
        MVM["Tiered Models<br/>(Tier 1 / Tier 2)"]
        MVM --> T1["tier1: Latest stable"]
        MVM --> T2["tier2: Fallback model"]
    end

    subgraph "RateLimiter"
        RL["Per-provider<br/>rate limiting"]
    end

    style MR fill:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style SF fill:#51cf66,color:#fff
```

---

## 8. Real-Time Audio → Transcript Pipeline

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph "Audio Capture"
        SA["SystemAudioCapture<br/>(Interviewer voice)"]
        MC["MicrophoneCapture<br/>(User voice)"]
    end

    subgraph "STT Providers (Failover Chain)"
        D1["Deepgram Streaming"]
        D2["OpenAI Streaming"]
        D3["Google STT"]
        D4["ElevenLabs STT"]
        D5["Soniox STT"]
        D6["NativelyPro STT"]
    end

    SA --> D1 & D2 & D3 & D4 & D5 & D6
    MC --> D1 & D2 & D3 & D4 & D5 & D6

    D1 & D2 & D3 & D4 & D5 & D6 --> TS["TranscriptSegment<br/>{speaker, text, timestamp, final}"]

    TS --> ST["SessionTracker"]

    ST --> DG1["Session ID Guard<br/>(cross-contamination)"]
    DG1 --> DG2["Chronological Guard<br/>(stale events)"]
    DG2 --> DG3["Duplicate Burst Guard<br/>(hash-based dedup)"]
    DG3 --> CI["Context Items[]<br/>(120s rolling window)"]
    DG3 --> FT["Full Transcript[]<br/>(epoch-compacted)"]

    FT --> EC{"Length > 1800?"}
    EC -->|Yes| ES["Epoch Summarization<br/>(RecapLLM)"]
    ES --> EP["Epoch Summaries[]<br/>(max 5)"]
    EP --> FT2["Trim oldest 500"]

    CI --> RW["getRollingWindowTranscript()<br/>(1600 token cap)"]
    FT --> FS["getFullSessionContext()<br/>(2800 token cap)"]

    style ST fill:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style DG3 fill:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
    style ES fill:#ffd43b,color:#333
```

