## 9. V1 Intelligence Architecture (New)

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph "Phase 1: Planning Engine"
        Q["Question"] --> PR["PlanningRules<br/>(Regex pattern matching)"]
        PR --> RS["ReasoningSteps[]<br/>(algorithm, STAR, tradeoffs...)"]
        RS --> RP["ReasoningPlan<br/>{steps, confidence, category}"]
        RP --> CG{"Confidence ≥ 0.45?"}
        CG -->|Yes| INJ["Inject into Brain"]
        CG -->|No| SKIP["Fallback: no plan"]
    end

    subgraph "Phase 2: Quality Evaluator"
        RESP["Generated Response"] --> QR["14 Domain QualityRules<br/>+ 9 Plan-Aware Checks"]
        QR --> QS["QualityScore<br/>(0-100)"]
        QS --> ACC{"isAcceptable?<br/>(≥ 60)"}
        ACC -->|Yes| LOG1["✅ Log OK"]
        ACC -->|No| LOG2["⚠️ Log Warning<br/>(observation only)"]
    end

    subgraph "Phase 3: Resume × JD"
        RES["Resume Text"] --> RJA["ResumeJDAnalyzer"]
        JD["Job Description"] --> RJA
        RJA --> SK["Matched Skills"]
        RJA --> GAP["Missing Skills"]
        RJA --> PROJ["Recommended Projects"]
        RJA --> EMPH["Suggested Emphasis"]
    end

    subgraph "Production Safety"
        TRY["try/catch wrapper"]
        TRY --> SAFE["Non-fatal: silent fallback"]
        DET["Deterministic: pure functions"]
        SYNC["Synchronous: zero latency"]
    end

    style RP fill:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style QS fill:#ffd43b,color:#333
    style RJA fill:#51cf66,color:#fff
    style SAFE fill:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
```

