## 10. Token Budget & Context Priority

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph "Token Budget System (9K Cap)"
        direction TB
        P6["🔒 Priority 6: User Message<br/>(NEVER dropped)"]
        P5["🔒 Priority 5: Latest Transcript<br/>(NEVER dropped)"]
        P4["Priority 4: RAG Knowledge"]
        P3["Priority 3: Custom Context"]
        P2["Priority 2: Resume / JD"]
        P1["Priority 1: Full History<br/>(dropped FIRST)"]
    end

    P1 --> TBE["TokenBudgetEnforcer"]
    P2 --> TBE
    P3 --> TBE
    P4 --> TBE
    P5 --> TBE
    P6 --> TBE

    TBE --> D{"Total > 9K?"}
    D -->|Yes| DROP["Drop lowest priority<br/>ENTIRE BLOCK<br/>(never slice strings)"]
    DROP --> D
    D -->|No| PASS["✅ Within budget"]

    subgraph "ContextPriorityEngine"
        CPE["Per-Brain Rankings"]
        CPE --> CR["Coding: transcript > supplemental > screen"]
        CPE --> BR["Behavioral: profile > transcript > rag"]
        CPE --> SR["System Design: transcript > rag > profile"]
        CPE --> RR["Resume: profile > jd > transcript"]
    end

    style P6 fill:#51cf66,color:#fff
    style P5 fill:#51cf66,color:#fff
    style DROP fill:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
```

---

## 11. Intent Classification — Three-Tier System

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Q["Interviewer's Last Turn"] --> T1["Tier 1: Regex Fast-Path<br/>< 1ms, high confidence"]

    T1 -->|Match| R1["coding / system_design / behavioral<br/>clarification / follow_up / etc."]
    T1 -->|No match| T2["Tier 2: Zero-Shot SLM<br/>(MobileBERT MNLI)<br/>~10-50ms"]

    T2 -->|Confidence ≥ 0.35| R2["SLM Classification"]
    T2 -->|Low confidence| T3["Tier 3: Context Heuristic<br/>Conversation flow analysis"]

    T3 --> R3["general / follow_up"]

    R1 & R2 & R3 --> AS["Answer Shape Guidance<br/>(injected into prompt)"]

    subgraph "Answer Shapes"
        AS --> S1["coding → Full working code"]
        AS --> S2["system_design → Architecture + tradeoffs"]
        AS --> S3["behavioral → STAR pattern"]
        AS --> S4["clarification → 1-2 sentences"]
    end

    style T1 fill:#51cf66,color:#fff
    style T2 fill:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style T3 fill:#ffd43b,color:#333
```

---

## 12. End-to-End Data Flow — Complete Request Lifecycle

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User/Interviewer
    participant Audio as Audio Capture
    participant STT as STT Provider
    participant ST as SessionTracker
    participant IE as IntelligenceEngine
    participant QU as QuestionUnderstanding
    participant PE as PlanningEngine
    participant Brain as Domain Brain
    participant CPE as ContextPriority
    participant TB as TokenBudget
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant QE as QualityEvaluator
    participant UI as React UI

    U->>Audio: Speaks
    Audio->>STT: Audio stream
    STT->>ST: TranscriptSegment (final)
    ST->>ST: Dedup + Session guards

    Note over IE: User triggers action (hotkey)
    IE->>IE: Dedupe + AbortController
    IE->>IE: buildContext()
    IE->>QU: Classify question
    QU-->>IE: {category, confidence}
    IE->>IE: estimateResponseDepth()
    IE->>PE: planReasoning(question, category, depth)
    PE-->>IE: ReasoningPlan

    IE->>Brain: execute(prompt, plan, analysis)
    Brain-->>IE: BrainOutput {instructions, priority}

    IE->>CPE: deriveContextPriority()
    CPE-->>IE: Source rankings + ordering

    IE->>TB: enforceTokenBudget(9K)
    IE->>LLM: Stream generation
    LLM-->>UI: Token-by-token streaming

    IE->>IE: Accumulate finalContent
    IE->>QE: evaluateResponseQuality()
    QE-->>IE: Score + issues (log only)
    IE->>UI: action_result event
```
